"}, {"w": "it", "s": 48.3, "e": 48.44, "c": ""}, {"w": "brings", "s": 48.44, "e": 48.64, "c": ""}, {"w": "Manhattan", "s": 48.64, "e": 48.94, "c": ""}, {"w": "350", "s": 48.94, "e": 49.46, "c": "red"}, {"w": "million", "s": 49.46, "e": 50.24, "c": ""}, {"w": "gallons", "s": 50.24, "e": 50.64, "c": ""}, {"w": "of", "s": 50.64, "e": 50.92, "c": ""}, {"w": "water", "s": 50.92, "e": 51.18, "c": ""}, {"w": "every", "s": 51.18, "e": 51.4, "c": ""}, {"w": "single", "s": 51.4, "e": 51.66, "c": ""}, {"w": "day.", "s": 51.66, "e": 52.04, "c": ""}, {"w": "No", "s": 52.42, "e": 52.54, "c": ""}, {"w": "gold,", "s": 52.54, "e": 52.74, "c": "red"}, {"w": "this", "s": 52.8, "e": 53.22, "c": ""}, {"w": "is", "s": 53.22, "e": 53.32, "c": ""}, {"w": "what", "s": 53.32, "e": 53.5, "c": ""}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.5, "e": 53.62, "c": ""}, {"w": "city", "s": 53.62, "e": 53.82, "c": ""}, {"w": "can't", "s": 53.82, "e": 54.14, "c": ""}, {"w": "live", "s": 54.14, "e": 54.3, "c": ""}, {"w": "without.", "s": 54.3, "e": 54.62, "c": ""}, {"w": "At", "s": 55.06, "e": 55.1, "c": ""}, {"w": "200", "s": 55.1, "e": 55.3, "c": "red"}, {"w": "meters,", "s": 55.3, "e": 55.8, "c": ""}, {"w": "you're", "s": 56.04, "e": 56.24, "c": ""}, {"w": "already", "s": 56.24, "e": 56.48, "c": ""}, {"w": "below", "s": 56.48, "e": 56.78, "c": ""}, {"w": "it.", "s": 56.78, "e": 57.06, "c": ""}, {"w": "Down", "s": 57.06, "e": 57.5, "c": ""}, {"w": "here,", "s": 57.5, "e": 57.78, "c": ""}, {"w": "just", "s": 57.78, "e": 58.14, "c": ""}, {"w": "rock.", "s": 58.14, "e": 58.44, "c": ""}, {"w": "So", "s": 59.04, "e": 59.08, "c": ""}, {"w": "what's", "s": 59.08, "e": 59.34, "c": ""}, {"w": "worth", "s": 59.34, "e": 59.5, "c": ""}, {"w": "more", "s": 59.5, "e": 59.74, "c": ""}, {"w": "under", "s": 59.74, "e": 59.94, "c": ""}, {"w": "New", "s": 59.94, "e": 60.1, "c": ""}, {"w": "York,", "s": 60.1, "e": 60.32, "c": ""}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.52, "e": 60.56, "c": ""}, {"w": "gold", "s": 60.56, "e": 60.78, "c": "red"}, {"w": "or", "s": 60.78, "e": 61.04, "c": ""}, {"w": "the", "s": 61.04, "e": 61.14, "c": ""}, {"w": "water", "s": 61.14, "e": 61.34, "c": ""}, {"w": "comment", "s": 61.34, "e": 61.66, "c": ""}, {"w": "one?", "s": 61.66, "e": 62.0, "c": ""}], "lines": [{"voice": "am_liam", "text": "What if you dug 200 meters under the bank that stores $800 billion in gold?", "start": 0.0, "end": 4.07}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Here's what's down there. And what's at the bottom isn't gold.", "start": 4.27, "end": 6.91}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "At 80 feet, you hit the vault. Over six thousand tons of gold.", "start": 7.11, "end": 10.17}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "About half a million bars. And none of it belongs to the bank.", "start": 10.37, "end": 13.16}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "It's stored for foreign central banks and the U.S. Treasury.", "start": 13.36, "end": 16.18}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "One sealed room. Its only door is a ninety-ton steel cylinder.", "start": 16.38, "end": 19.53}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "It takes three people to open it.", "start": 19.73, "end": 21.5}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "The walls are steel-reinforced concrete. So you dig around it.", "start": 21.7, "end": 24.64}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Keep going. At over 170 feet, you pass the deepest subway station in New York.", "start": 24.84, "end": 29.0}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Now it gets hot. Every 100 meters adds about 3 degrees Celsius.", "start": 29.2, "end": 32.8}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "At 200 meters, that's 5 to 6 degrees warmer than the surface.", "start": 33.0, "end": 36.44}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "And if water breaks in? The pressure hits twenty times the air around you.", "start": 36.64, "end": 39.86}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Keep going. Something huge is right below you.", "start": 40.06, "end": 42.3}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "At about 500 feet, you hit a tunnel twelve feet wide.", "start": 43.7, "end": 46.54}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Water Tunnel Number 3.", "start": 46.74, "end": 48.18}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "It brings Manhattan 350 million gallons of water. Every single day.", "start": 48.38, "end": 52.2}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "No gold. This is what the city can't live without.", "start": 52.4, "end": 54.82}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "At 200 meters, you're already below it.", "start": 55.02, "end": 57.21}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "Down here? Just rock.", "start": 57.41, "end": 58.76}, {"voice": "am_liam", "text": "So what's worth more under New York... the gold, or the water? Comment one.", "start": 58.96, "end": 62.14}], "K": [[0, 0], [4.27, 1.5], [7.11, 20], [10.37, 25], [24.64, 34], [26.92, 53], [29.2, 62], [33.0, 100], [36.64, 128], [42.3, 146], [43.7, 152], [55.02, 188], [57.41, 200], [62.74, 200]]}